To be explicit about one thing that is easy to misread: the line
`license = "MIT"` in the TOML sample in README.md is a data field describing a
third-party repository that this tool lists. It is not this repository's
licence, and it does not grant anything here.

The maintainer will replace this file with the chosen licence. If you want to
contribute before that happens, please open an issue and ask.
